# v3.0 - user requested SINGLE URL; previous Extended is now EXPERIMENTAL.
# 22 script declarations does NOT mean 22 working scripts or legitimate Premium.
# Many duyvinh09 source URLs previously returned 404 (NOT fixed by merging).
# 39 script sources preserved below as documentation. No private CA or passphrase.
# Shared RevenueCat endpoint impacts unrelated apps. Kept only ONE pair
# of Locket handlers; competing generic RevenueCat and Apple purchase hooks REMOVED.
# Broad unrelated Apple geolocation MITM removed; test only on authorized devices.
# Backup Shadowrocket settings and avoid enabling other All-in-One modules.
# Do NOT upload or share ca-p12 or ca-passphrase. Locally create CA on iPhone.

